\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces We present SPAR3D\xspace  , a state-of-the-art 3D reconstructor that reconstructs high-quality 3D meshes from single-view images. SPAR3D\xspace  enjoys a fast reconstruction speed at 0.7\xspace  seconds and supports interactive user edits. }}{1}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
