\newlabel{fig:wild}{{6}{7}{\textbf {Generalization Results.} We show qualitative results of \method on in-the-wild images from 2D generative models (top 2 rows) and ImageNet (bottom 2 rows). The reconstructed meshes exhibit accurate geometric structures with great textures, demonstrating a strong generalization performance of \method }{figure.caption.27}{}}
